==== cold_run_food_tithe.the_third_year sig ('case', 'data') (20251 chars) asks-in-source ['ezras_penalty', 'one_tithe_not_two', 'the_animal_tithe_now', 'the_convert_at_the_gate', 'the_courtyard_from_your_gates', 'the_four_in_want', 'the_gifts_exempt', 'the_levite_never_interrupted', 'the_measures', 'the_removal_date', 'the_resident_alien_at_the_gate', 'the_seventh_year_by_the_cycle', 'the_tithes_new_year', 'the_uses_barred']
def the_third_year(case, data):
