  seducers.the_inciter({ask:the_entrapment})                             ("the entrapment (13:7, 13:9) — the only capital case with hidden witnesses (Sanhedrin 67a:3, 12): the lit inner room, the dark outer room, 'say what you said to me in seclusion'; the retraction's exemption, 'it is our duty' stoned (67a:5, 13); no forewarning to two hearers (67a:4): the inciter who 
