  seducers.the_inciter({ask:the_inciters_kin})                           ("the inciter's kin (13:7) — the brother by the father, the mother's son, the son and the daughter of any kind, the betrothed and the married, the convert, THE FATHER in 'as your own soul' (the Sifrei 87:4-11): THE LINE inciter_law_declared at the counter's day; the son who strikes his inciting fath
