  seducers.the_header({ask:the_headers_seal})                            ("the header's seal (13:1) — 'you shall not add to it nor take from it' = 4:2's law in the singular (the only two seats; seven tokens in order; OH.the_exhortation by CALL): THE LINE word_sealed REUSING adding_barred — a second entry on Israel at the chapter's own day; the readback row VERBATIM in ki
  seducers.the_header({ask:the_three_grains})                            ("the three grains (13:1) — the word's (the priests' blessing, 82:5; Rosh Hashanah 28b), the count's (the four species (1, 1, 3, 2) from the verse's own numbers — Sukkah 34b:3-4; the strings' minimum — Menachot 41b-42a), the rite's (the mixed bloods — Mishnah Zevachim 8:10, Zevachim 80a-81a: the act
==== cold_run_seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test sig ('case', 'data') (24391 chars) asks-in-source ['elijah_at_carmel', 'the_established_prophet', 'the_evil_purged', 'the_exemptions', 'the_exodus_formula_with_redeeming', 'the_false_prophets_table', 'the_lord_is_testing_you', 'the_oven_of_akhnai', 'the_prophet_and_the_dreamer', 'the_prophets_death', 'the_sign_and_the_wonder', 'the_signs_status', 'the_six_verbs']
