  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_evil_purged})               ("the evil purged (13:6) — THE FORMULA'S FIRST SEAT OF NINE (the DB's seats all in the book; 86:10 the doer removed): evil_purged_from_the_midst NAMED here — a body effect on the condemned person at the case, reused at the eight seats ahead; the homographs (purge_deadline, purge_commanded) named, no
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_exemptions})                ("the exemptions (13:6) — 'for he spoke': of his own will, knowing — not the coerced, not the misled (the Sifrei 86:1-2); the part-keeper exempt (Sanhedrin 90a:5): the prophet who spoke under duress exempt", ['exempt'])
