  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_false_prophets_table})      ("the false prophet's table (13:3, 13:6) — the essence abolished: strangled; the part: exempt; the hour: heeded; IDOLATRY EVEN FOR A DAY: liable, all agree (Sanhedrin 90a:2-6; Mishnah Sanhedrin 11:5-6; SA.census by CALL): the prophet who keeps part and voids part exempt", ['exempt'])
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_lord_is_testing_you})       ("the LORD is testing you (13:4) — the participle's one seat; Genesis 22:1's tested the first seat on the tape (MM.moriah by CALL), 8:2 and 8:16 by CALL (GL), 6:16's test_barred the mirror (HI): THE WRITE tested_by_the_lord — a STATUS on Israel at the chapter's own day; the one who follows the sign 
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_oven_of_akhnai})            ("the oven of Akhnai (13:2-3) — the carob, the stream, the walls, the heavenly voice, and 'it is not in heaven': the sign not decisive in law (Bava Metzia 59b): the sage who rules by the sign accepted against", ['accepted'])
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_prophet_and_the_dreamer})   ("the prophet and the dreamer (13:2) — the dream the prophets' channel (Numbers 12:6-8 by CALL; the Sifrei 83:2), the prophet's forms Moses' (83:1); the sign the title's proof and the presumed prophet exempt from it (Sanhedrin 89b:6-7): THE LINE prophet_test_declared at the counter's day; the readba
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_prophets_death})            ("the prophet's death (13:6) — a PARAMETER: stoning (the Sifrei's majority by I2 on 'thrust' with 13:11; the Rabbis at Sanhedrin 89b:15-19) / strangling (R. Shimon; Mishnah Sanhedrin 11:1 — the answer sheet's arm; the Rambam 5:2): the false prophet who preaches idolatry put to death (the answer shee
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_sign_and_the_wonder})       ('the sign and the wonder (13:2-3) — the sign in the heavens, the wonder on the earth (the Sifrei 83:4-5; 1 Kings 13:3 the one two-token kin); the sign the credential: the prophet whose sign comes to pass and preaches nothing against the Torah accepted', ['accepted'])
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_signs_status})              ("the sign's status (13:3-4) — a PARAMETER: R. Yosei HaGelili's dominion (the sign real, the sun stopped, do not heed — Sanhedrin 90a:10) / R. Akiva's fallen prophet (Hananiah — 90a:11); either arm THE HEARING BARRED: THE WRITE false_prophet_hearing_barred — a BLOCK on Israel at the chapter's own da
  seducers.the_prophet_and_the_test({ask:the_six_verbs})                 ("the six verbs (13:5) — walk, fear, keep, obey, serve, cleave: 10:20's four (ST by CALL; cleaving_commanded on the tape — the readback row EXPANDED) and 6:13's three (HI by CALL); the first verb the cloud (85:1 — cloud_lifted a run citation), 'His voice' the prophets' (85:4): THE WRITE cleaving_com
